// Companions build profile: separate Watch and TV hosts and the LAN and Watch relays
// (docs/BUILD_AND_DISTRIBUTION.md).
//
// Attached today: LabWatch (scheme LabWatch). It installs directly to a paired Watch and is not
// embedded in the iPhone app, so CoreLocal never depends on Watch provisioning. A future TV host
// attaches here too.
//
// Simulator builds need no team. Transport, haptics, and camera evidence need physical devices.
// Swift code can check `#if LAB_PROFILE_COMPANIONS`.

LAB_BUILD_PROFILE = Companions
LAB_PROFILE_EXTERNAL_SETUP = Physical paired devices for transport evidence; any team for a device install
SWIFT_ACTIVE_COMPILATION_CONDITIONS = $(inherited) LAB_PROFILE_COMPANIONS
